  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1712080110_4673090_ffca63fd8d8b28f04b11a7938799e450.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>At The-Mix-Up, our commitment to excellence is showcased in our meticulous sourcing practices, working closely with local communities to receive our precious oil within days of each harvest. In doing so, we not only honor the rich heritage of Batana oil but also support the sustainable practices of the indigenous people, creating a seamless blend of tradition and innovation in every jar and bottle.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Embark on The-Mix-Up Journey and discover the power of nature's secrets encapsulated in our exceptional Batana oil sourced from the lush region of La Moskitia in Honduras. In this pristine environment, indigenous communities, masters in the art of harvesting, delicately extract this precious elixir from the fruit's seeds through a time-honored method, ensuring that every drop retains its natural goodness. Batana oil, revered by the Miskito people for generations, stands out for its unrivaled ability to nourish and fortify hair from within, promoting growth, enhancing shine, and combating dryness and frizz. </span><br><br>Payment Terms: Payments are made on the 1st of every month.&nbsp;<br><br></p>",
